          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare-nono Rwot te cako kwanyo lobo mogo oko i kom lobo me Icrael. Abaka Kajael me Curia olwenyo i jo Icrael te loyo lobo me Icrael luŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ame rik onwoŋo tye tutuŋ kide me Jordan kun mao iye lobo me Gilead ducu kede lobo a jo Gad, kede me a jo Reuben karacel kede me a jo Manace, cakere i Aroer ame tye i ŋet kulo Amon, omao lobo Gilead kede Bacan luŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kop ocele luŋ i kom Yeko ame mom ocoo kan, ginnoro ducu ame en otio kede teko mere ducu, gin luŋ tye ocoo i buk me Tekwaro, ame tito kop i kom oloc me Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeko rik doŋ te to te wot weo karacel i kwari mere, ote yiko kome i Camaria. Wode Yekoyakaji en ame te leyo kakare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeko oloo jo Icrael i Camaria mwakki pyeraryo wie aboro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.10.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
